"""protect_apk.py — turn ANY APK into a modified-clone style protected APK.

Reproduces the exact reference transform:
  * small "update" loader wrapper (store UI + tiny classes.dex)
  * input APK  zip-deflate -> AES-256-GCM(KDF) encrypted  ->  assets/nvcgehin
  * 90 PKWARE-encrypted poison entries (breaks apktool/jadx:
      invalid CEN header (encrypted entry))
  * zipalign + apksigner v1+v2+v3 (v1 verifies FALSE, exactly like the source)
  * FIXED: version bumping so updates install over existing installs
  * ADVANCED: Play Protect stealth, anti-detection improvements

Usage:
  python3 protect_apk.py --apk any.apk -o protected.apk [--fresh-pkg]
  python3 protect_apk.py --verify protected.apk --orig any.apk
"""
